ne learning, starting with methods for reasoning under uncertainty. We cover learning of decision trees from examples, reinforcement learning in Markov Decision Processes, perceptron learning, and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":227947,"global_rank":117687},{"name":"metasoarous/entrez_fetch","owner":"metasoarous","html_url":"https://github.com/metasoarous/entrez_fetch","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Command line utility for downloading genbank results by accession number","topics":[],"score":227937,"global_rank":117694},{"name":"colobas/obras","owner":"colobas","html_url":"https://github.com/colobas/obras","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"hard difficult expert very tough","topics":[],"score":227933,"global_rank":117702},{"name":"codynhat/mmpool","owner":"codynhat","html_url":"https://github.com/codynhat/mmpool","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227933,"global_rank":117704},{"name":"izhangzhihao/zhwiki-word2vec","owner":"izhangzhihao","html_url":"https://github.com/izhangzhihao/zhwiki-word2vec","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227933,"global_rank":117705},{"name":"makoshark/twitter-api-cdsw-solutions","owner":"makoshark","html_url":"https://github.com/makoshark/twitter-api-cdsw-solutions","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227925,"global_rank":117709}]